{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19547","headline":"玉绳低建章 · 张仲素","name":"玉绳低建章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢迢玉绳下，芒彩正阑干。\n稍复临鳷鹊，方疑近露寒。\n微明连粉堞，的皪映仙盘。\n横接河流照，低将夜色残。\n天榆随影没，宫树与光攒。\n遐想西垣客，长吟欲罢难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张仲素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}